  "description": "<p>⭐ <em><strong>Candlelight: Disney Love Songs</strong> is the ultimate concert experience for Disney fans! Immerse yourself in the world of Disney through live renditions of your favorite love songs, all performed classically by the light of a thousand candles.</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🎵 Live music performances of beloved Disney love songs<br>\r\n🕯️A fairy-tale candlelit atmosphere that brings romance to life<br>\r\n💕 Iconic melodies that stir your emotions and memories<br>\r\n💫 A nostalgic experience that captures love in every note</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📍 Venue: Southwark Cathedral<br>\r\n📅 Dates and times: select your dates/times directly in the ticket selector<br>\r\n⏳ Duration: 60 minutes. Doors open 45 minutes before the show. No entry once it starts<br>\r\n👤 Age requirement: 5 years old or older. Anyone under the age of 16 must be accompanied by an adult<br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: this venue is wheelchair accessible<br>\r\n❓ View the FAQs for this event <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vTH1a2g4iLj2_LMXyzfWtnSH6SNpOMa6D5Dpwp3-ngbjah-oJUCHtkwBU0H36GS9wjUW4esWYZ3wJMt/pub\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n🪑 Seating is assigned on a first come first served basis in each zone<br>\r\n🚇 Get there with the TfL Network<br>\r\n🕯️ If you would like to book a private concert or buy regular tickets for a large group (+30 people), click <a href=\"https://candlelightexperience.com/groups/#groups-form\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br>\r\n🎻 Check out all the <a href=\"https://feverup.com/en/london/candlelight-london\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Candlelight concerts</a> in London<br>\r\n🎁 To treat your friends and family to a Candlelight gift card, click <a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/95252\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>&nbsp;<br>\r\n🏰 There’s no strict dress code, but feel free to embrace the romantic Disney spirit: think elegant, whimsical, or inspired by your favorite Disney moments!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nEnter a world of enchantment and nostalgia with <em>Candlelight: Disney Love Songs</em>. This special concert brings together beloved songs from Disney’s most romantic films, performed live in a beautiful candlelit setting. Whether you’re a lifelong Disney fan or discovering these songs for the first time, this concert will transport you into a world of love, memories, and musical wonder.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Licensed by Disney Concerts.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Candlelight: Disney Love Songs Program</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><em>Can You Feel the Love Tonight - The Lion King (1994)</em></li>\r\n\t<li><em>Love Is an Open Door - Frozen (2013)</em></li>\r\n\t<li><em>Some Day My Prince Will Come - Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs (1937)</em></li>\r\n\t<li><em>I Won't Say (I'm In Love) - Hercules (1997)</em></li>\r\n\t<li><em>Remember Me - Coco (2017)</em></li>\r\n\t<li><em>Dos Oruguitas - Encanto (2021)</em></li>\r\n\t<li><em>Something There - Beauty and the Beast (1991)</em></li>\r\n\t<li><em>Beauty and the Beast - Beauty and the Beast (1991)</em></li>\r\n\t<li><em>True Love's Kiss - Enchanted (2007)</em></li>\r\n\t<li><em>Kiss the Girl - The Little Mermaid (1989)</em></li>\r\n\t<li><em>A Whole New World - &nbsp;Aladdin (1992)</em></li>\r\n\t<li><em>When She Loved Me - Toy Story 2 (1999)</em></li>\r\n\t<li><em>You'll Be In My Heart - Tarzán (1999)</em></li>\r\n\t<li><em>I See the Light - Tangled (2010)</em></li>\r\n\t<li><em>Married Life - Up (2009)</em></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Performers</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>String Quartet</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Seating Map</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<center><img align=\"middle\" class=\"extra-image-plan\" src=\"https://images.feverup.com/plan/photo/2ecae8bc-7f1e-11ef-b20c-42fcd064a931.jpg\" width=\"290px\"></center>",
